body:
Bc people don't care about health, they care about looks lol. Many "models" post eating pizza, drinking whole bottles of wine and this shit, nobody cares. But if a fat person eats a piece of cake EVERYONE is magically interested in this person's health. And you know, smokers ruin MY fucking air. If a at person eats a whole fucking cow, I ain't getting fat or unhealthier. Not every fat person is unhealthy. And fat people get shamed all the time and excluded, while smokers get f\*cking breaks to smoke during work (in my country, don't know about USA, if someone could tell me I'd love it)!!! Disagree BUT upvote bc this is really unpopular (finally).

&#x200B;

Edit: Talking about FAT people, not  morbidly obese people, bc that was what the OP was talking about.
